      "front_content": {
        "text": "中国特色文化词汇的关键，不是逐字翻译，而是保持术语稳定与语域自然。\n\n高频表达：\n1. 非物质文化遗产 -> intangible cultural heritage\n2. 文化自信 -> cultural confidence\n3. 中华优秀传统文化 -> fine traditional Chinese culture\n4. 文化传承 -> preserve and pass on cultural traditions\n\n如何把这些表达写进自然的四六级句子？",
        "image_url": null,
        "audio_url": null,
        "highlight_ranges": []
      },
      "back_content": {
        "text": "Digital tools help preserve intangible cultural heritage and pass it on to younger generations. 先用preserve说保护，再用pass ... on to说传给后代。",
        "explanation": "intangible cultural heritage是保护对象，younger generations是传承对象。preserve与pass on分别说明保存和传下去；不是把一串中文名词逐个换成英文。"
      },
      "analysis_content": {
        "text": "intangible cultural heritage是保护对象，younger generations是传承对象。preserve与pass on分别说明保存和传下去；不是把一串中文名词逐个换成英文。",
        "tips": [
          "用一句话说清“谁保护什么、传给谁”，检查动词与宾语是否完整。"
        ]
      },
